      "id": "R12",
      "task_id": "12-reverse-refusal",
      "prompt": "这张低清柱图和 3D 饼图能不能反推数据？给出证据等级、风险和替代。",
      "expected": {
        "primary": "viz-reverse",
        "scenes": [],
        "support": [
          "viz-audit"
